# Copy to .env for local development.
#
# Leave unset to use the Vite dev proxy (see vite.config.ts), which forwards /api/* to
# http://localhost:8080 and needs no CORS configuration on the API side.
#
# Set this only if the API is hosted elsewhere — a deployed Railway backend, say — in which
# case that origin must list this app's origin in Cors__AllowedOrigins__0, or the browser will
# block every request regardless of what this is set to.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://dms-backend-production-860c.up.railway.app
